        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋilowi ŋulu ke esacaradoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tonyarau lokaato kon Aron ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa neni kon aneni a Ŋisirael a ŋuluce, eketiyanakis ayoŋ ikwapei ŋisacaradotin. Tonyarau iŋes ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa lu: Nadab, Abiu ka Eleasar ta Isamar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ŋilowi ŋulu ka apolou ka akibuses ŋulu enapi lokaato kon Aron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisirwor ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu epedorete akiirar ŋakiro, ŋulu adau ayoŋ ainakin aosou, tolimok ikes atemar kitiyaut ŋilowi ka Aron ŋulu ituruworere iŋes esacaradoti kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋilowi lu ikes emaikina ŋituŋa ŋul kitiyaut: Eboli ŋolo ka atorobu, arapet, ekaaso, esati ka akopiya ta arokoba. Emaikina ikes kitiyaut ŋilowi ŋul aŋuna ka Aron alokaato kon ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa eketiyanakiniata ayoŋ ikwapei ŋisacaradotin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ikes kiwuakis lolowi ŋul egolid, kitiyaut a ŋanaŋgae a ŋunapusiyek, a ŋunakipura-areŋak ka a ŋuna areŋak, ido torae ŋuna amilimilak.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Arapet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina ikes kiwuakis narapet egolid, kitiyaut a ŋanaŋgae a ŋunapusiyek, a ŋunakipura-areŋak ka a ŋuna areŋak, torae ŋuna amilimilak ŋuna edonyunit ituŋanan ŋini eyeni akidony ejok nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todonyokisi narapet ŋin ŋaraco ŋaarei ŋuna ikacakina loseketa alocileta a arapet, ikotere eenianakinio arapet a nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisikwaana arokoba ka arapet ŋin isibusitae a ŋiboro a ŋulu itiyaunitere arapet a lu: Egolid, ŋanaŋgae ŋunapusiyek, ŋunakipura-areŋak ka ŋuna areŋak ta ŋuna amilimilak ŋuna edonyuno ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyoŋ tolemu ŋamoru ŋaarei ŋuna areŋak puu ŋuna enyaritae onikis, kiciek nen ŋirorwa a ŋidwe a Yakob a ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiciek ŋirorwa a ŋikanikapei namoru apei ka ŋirorwa a ŋuluce a ŋulukanikapei namoru ŋinace. Kiciek ŋirorwa ŋulu nen irearit ameun a ŋolo kiyae a Yakob tari neni a ŋolo ŋoorit a Yakob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiciek ŋirorwa a ŋidwe a Yakob a ŋulusapa a ŋul namoru ŋun ŋaarei lopite ŋolo sek itiyaa ituŋanan ŋini ice ŋirorwa namoru. Ani irikakin, toenik ŋamoru ŋun iwapei isibakit a ŋiriko a ŋulu itiyaunitae ke egolid, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido toenik ŋamoru ŋun ŋunaarei naraco ŋuna eya narapet aloseketa. Eruwor ŋamoru ŋun ŋuna etamunitere ŋidwe a Yakob ŋulusapa, Aron iŋes emaikina eryoŋit ŋirorwa ŋul aloseketa keŋ, ikotere Ekapolon etamunitor ŋituŋa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ke egolid ŋiboro ŋulu isibakitae a ŋiriko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kitiyau ke egolid bon ŋiriko ŋiarei ŋulu eluguritae ikwa aikit, ido kiwuanak neni a ŋulu isibakere ŋiboro ŋuluce.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eboli ŋolo ka atorobu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inak ituŋanan ŋini eyeni akitiya ejok nooi, kitiyau eboli ŋolo enapyo etubio ŋakiro, emaikina kitiyaunae ikwaan ka arapet, eyai egolid, kitiyaunitetei a ŋanaŋgae a ŋunapusiyek, a ŋunakipura-areŋak ka a ŋuna areŋak ta ŋuna amilimilak ŋuna edonyuno ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina eboli ŋol eriyan ŋiwaetin ŋuluomwon daadaŋ, irotakina ŋarwa ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedaun akitiyaun eboli, emaikina topetakinae kidiama ŋilaino ŋiomwon ŋulu a ŋamoru a ŋuna epol egyelit, elain ŋolo esyaunan emaikina eyakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna areŋak puu ŋuna enyaritae Karinelian ka ŋuna enyaŋiyarito ŋuna enyaritae Topas ta ŋuna alibak nooi ŋuna enyaritae karisolite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elain ŋolo a ŋiarei emaikina eyakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Yasiper ka ŋunapusiyek ŋuna enyaritae Sapire ta ŋuna alibak nooi ŋuna enyaritae Emerald. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elain ŋolo a ŋiuni emaikina eyakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Jacinis ka ŋuna egogoŋ nooi ŋuna enyaritae Agate ta ŋunapusiyek-areŋak ŋuna enyaritae Amesist. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elain ŋolo a ŋiomwon emaikina eyakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna enyaŋiyarito ŋuna enyaritae karisolite ka ŋuna areŋak puu ŋuna enyaritae onikis ta ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Yasiper. Emaikina ŋamoru ŋun daadaŋ eenianakinitae iwapei, isibakitae a ŋiriko a ŋulu itiyaunitae ke egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋamoru ŋun erae ŋatomon ka ŋaarei, a ŋinamoru egiritae ekiro epei a ŋidwe a Yakob a ŋulusapa; ŋolokiro imarit ekabila epei alotooma ŋikabilae ŋulutomon ka ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ke egolid bon ŋiriko ŋulu esonyitae ikwa ŋaunoi, kiwuak loboli ŋolo ka atorobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ŋikabobooe ŋiarei aŋuna ke eboli a ŋol, toenik locileta ŋuluarei ŋulu a eboli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toenik ŋiriko ŋuluarei ŋul lokabobooe ŋulu alocileta ke eboli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido toenia epeiwae ŋiriko locileta ŋuluarei ŋulu alokidiama eboli, totapakin naraco ŋuna ka arapet ŋuna eya kidiama ŋiseketa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau nabo ke egolid ŋikabobooe ŋiarei, toenik locileta ŋuluarei ŋulu alokwap eboli, toenik alokwap alodiyete arapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau nabo a egolid ŋikabobooe ŋice ŋiarei, toenik kwap ŋaraco ŋuna a ŋiseketa, neni iryamyata eboli ka neni isibusitae anarapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina toenikinae ka ausi a ŋinapus ŋikabobooe a eboli lokabobooe a arapet, toenikinae ausi ŋinapus ŋin narokoba ŋina ka acir; ikotere nyidalidala eboli anarapet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Apaki daadaŋ ŋina elomarya Aron nakibois ŋina Asegan nooi alotooma Eema, emaikina iŋes tonap anatorobu keŋ eboli ŋolotubet ŋakiro ŋol, ŋolo eya ŋamoru ŋuna igiritae ŋirorwa a ŋidwe a Yakob a ŋulusapa. Erae ŋun aŋuna ka atamunitor ikes alokiŋaren Ekapolon a ŋinapaki a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak loboli ŋol ŋolotubet ŋakiro ŋiboro lu: Ibore ŋini isileereununui ŋakiro ŋini enyaritae Urim ka ŋini isiyoonokini ŋakiro ŋini enyaritae Sumim. Emaikina Aron enapit ŋiboro ŋul anatorobu keŋ apaki daadaŋ ŋina elomarya nakibois ŋina Asegan nooi ŋina eyai Ekapolon. Aŋun, emaikina Aron torubak enapit eboli anatorobu keŋ apaki daadaŋ ŋina etubio ŋakiro a Ŋisirael alokiŋaren Ekapolon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋilowi ŋice ŋulu a asacaradotonu,",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kitiyau ekaaso ŋolopus ŋolo ani enapyo, kidokokin arapet alokidiama keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Topedok kidiŋ keŋ neni itori akou enapyo, ido totokok nen a ŋiusyo a ŋulu esonyony ejok nooi kiryam; kikwaanikin ka neni etokere abilet ka anaŋga. Erae ŋun ikotere nyecila nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuanak neni iwasi alokwap a elou a ŋol ŋikatelitel ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋaraito ke ekitoe a ŋolo ikwaan ka ekacikicikit. Emaikina ŋiraŋgi a ŋikatelitel a ŋul erae ŋulupusiyek, ŋulu kipura-areŋak ka ŋulu areŋak. Kiwuanak ŋitworoi ŋulu cicik ŋulu itiyaunitae ke egolid nakidiŋon a ŋikatelitel a ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyitutupanak ŋitworoi make, kori ŋikatelitel make aneni iwasi alokwap ekaaso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina Aron tonap ekaaso ŋol apaki ŋina elimonokinia ŋituŋa ŋakiro ka Akuj. Emaikina ŋituŋa epupete ŋitworoi erwosi apaki ŋina eyakar Aron nakibois ŋina Asegan nooi ŋina eyai Ekapolon ka apaki ŋina ebunio iŋes a nen; ikotere nyidoŋok iŋes nen erae ketwaniki nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kitiyau ke egolid bon akaparaparat ŋina ka akou, ido kiciek nen ŋakiro nu: ‘Itesegunitae aŋuna ke Ekapolon.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toenik akaparaparat ŋin kiŋaren akopiya ka ausi a ŋinapus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina enapit Aron akaparaparat ŋin aloreet keŋ. Adyakaret daadaŋ ŋina eyakaun nainakineta ŋuna adaut Ŋisirael akitaleun ainakin ayoŋ, eruwor nakou ka Aron. Eruwor adyakaret ŋinaruba aneni ka Aron, nai Ŋisirael ŋuluce eruwor ŋulu italakarito Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kitiyau esati ananaŋga a ŋina amilimilan ka kitiyau akopiya ananaŋga a ŋina amilimilan. Inak ituŋanan ŋini eyeni akidony ejok todonyonok narokoba ŋitorubei ŋulu ebusak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kitiyau aŋuna a ŋidwe ka Aron a ŋulusapa ŋisatyo, ŋarokobae ka ŋakopiyae. Ituruworete ŋinapito ŋul ikes ŋulu ekerer ka itopoloorito ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku kitanap iyoŋ lokaato kon Aron ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ŋilowi ŋul, kios ikes a akimyet, kitaleu, ikotere eruworosi ŋisacaradotin ŋulu eketiyanakinete ayoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau aŋuna kec ŋisiriwali ŋulu ajokak nooi, ŋulu amilimilak, ŋulu aoyak ŋinapei anacir tari namuroi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina Aron ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa tonapa ŋilowi ŋul ŋapakio daadaŋ ŋuna elomaryata ikes tooma Eema ŋolo iryamununosi ikes; kori ŋapakio ŋuna eapiyaryata ikes Namuroet elosete akitiya anakibois a ŋina Asegan. Erae ŋun ikotere nyebu asecenu nen, ido totwaka ikes aŋuna eleryoto. Emaikina ŋun toruwor etal ŋoloruba aneni ka Aron ka ŋiletok keŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
